<title>UK: Rugby League-Wigan beats Canterbury in Super League.</title>
<headline>Rugby League-Wigan beats Canterbury in Super League.</headline>
<dateline>WIGAN, England 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>World club championship super league result on Monday:</p>
<p>Wigan (England) 31 Canterbury (Australia) 24 (halftime: 12-18)</p>
</text>
